de, then?","nextNodeIds":[741660204]},{"nodeId":741660204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":2023280394,"text":"Congratulations on running into me today! I am the single nicest resident of the entire Fortress.","nextNodeIds":[741660205]},{"nodeId":741660205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":306067762,"text":"Today, allow me to help you familiarize yourself with the Fortress. Of course, it will all be \"free.\"","nextNodeIds":[741660206]},{"nodeId":741660206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":23168194,"text":"Actually, I already know the place quite well.","nextNodeIds":[741660207]},{"nodeId":741660207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":2801118650,"text":"Oh, don't say that!","nextNodeIds":[741660208]},{"nodeId":741660208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":3628501874,"text":"Perhaps you think you've got your bearings, but under my guidance, I believe you'll discover all kinds of things you never noticed.","nextNodeIds":[741660209]},{"nodeId":741660209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":825369626,"text":"There's such a thing as a free lunch?","nextNodeIds":[741660210]},{"nodeId":741660210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":3770370722,"text":"Of course, of course! Like I said, I'm the kindest resident of the entire Fortress.","nextNodeIds":[741660211]},{"nodeId":741660211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1239941354,"text":"Huh, this guy's kind of weird. We've only just met and he's all buddy-buddy!","nextNodeIds":[741660212]},{"nodeId":741660212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":3822949514,"text":"Haha, my friend, think nothing of it! How about this, you two discuss it amongst yourselves first, and I'll wait over here to hear your decision.","nextNodeIds":[741660213]},{"nodeId":741660213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":532815994,"text":"Once you've made up your minds, come find me.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7416602,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}},{"subQuestId":7416603,"order":3,"stepDescription":"Accept the strange person's invitation","stepDescTextMapHash":810372956,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7416603,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["13791"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7416603],"talks":[{"talkId":7416603,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","",""