"nextNodeIds":[741660403]},{"nodeId":741660403,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":167282642,"text":"Hmm, is that all? This is just stuff anyone learns on their first day!","nextNodeIds":[741660404]},{"nodeId":741660404,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":2808910850,"text":"Calm down, calm down, I have some secret information as well. They say there is a secret codeword you can say to Bran when claiming your Welfare Meal, which will allow you to obtain the legendary mystery meal!","nextNodeIds":[741660405]},{"nodeId":741660405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1820614034,"text":"Ah, really? What codeword?","nextNodeIds":[741660406]},{"nodeId":741660406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":548660722,"text":"Unfortunately, I do not know. Regarding the codeword, I await the day you discover it for yourselves.","nextNodeIds":[741660407]},{"nodeId":741660407,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3465678338,"text":"That's totally Paimon's line!","nextNodeIds":[741660408]},{"nodeId":741660408,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":2362268034,"text":"Do not worry about such trivial details! Our next stop, the Tri-Coupon Troupe!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7416604,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_340800417:4482.252,121.3