 is... the lift to the production zone.","nextNodeIds":[741660602]},{"nodeId":741660602,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2935259690,"text":"This place doesn't have strange rumors too, does it?","nextNodeIds":[741660603]},{"nodeId":741660603,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":1851750586,"text":"No, that is does not. It's just that I really hate this place.","nextNodeIds":[741660604]},{"nodeId":741660604,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":276749002,"text":"Oh? Why's that?","nextNodeIds":[741660605]},{"nodeId":741660605,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":424866634,"text":"Because...","nextNodeIds":[741660606]},{"nodeId":741660606,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1560309714,"text":"Because...?","nextNodeIds":[741660607]},{"nodeId":741660607,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":4181803218,"text":"Because I don't wanna work!","nextNodeIds":[741660608]},{"nodeId":741660608,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":2297783018,"text":"I'm only here because I didn't wanna work, so I stole a loaf of bread to feed myself because I was so hungry, and was sentenced as a result.","nextNodeIds":[741660609]},{"nodeId":741660609,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":3388563042,"text":"So why, why do you still have to work in the Fortress of Meropide!?","nextNodeIds":[741660610]},{"nodeId":741660610,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":1632864178,"text":"\"Any little bit of work will knock me out!\" That's my life's motto.","nextNodeIds":[741660611]},{"nodeId":741660611,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1373542522,"text":"Gah! It feels like he's getting all weird just being here, let's get out of here and go to the next place.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7416606,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_340800419:4434.701,121.600,4682.880,0.000,169.255,0.000]"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"}}},{"subQuestId":7416607,"order":7,"stepDescription":"Tour the Pankration Ring","stepDescTextMapHash":798719764,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7416607,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL":["[3_340800229:4397.292,125.517,4661.997,0.000,122.997,0.000]"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_LOCATION"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[7416607],"talks":[{"talkId":7416607,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","