:"Strange Person","textMapHash":575996874,"text":"Of course, but don't listen to those outside rumors. That's just an image intended to fool others. Come, come, come, I have a consent form over here, if you just sign it...","nextNodeIds":[741660704]},{"nodeId":741660704,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13792,"speakerName":"Guard","textMapHash":2586677610,"text":"Hey! It's you again! Tricking people into signing consent forms to register for the competition again, are we? You won't escape this time!","nextNodeIds":[741660705]},{"nodeId":741660705,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13792,"speakerName":"Guard","textMapHash":1143138698,"text":"You two are quite lucky that I noticed just before you were going to sign those forms!","nextNodeIds":[741660706]},{"nodeId":741660706,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13792,"speakerName":"Guard","textMapHash":643544362,"text":"In any case, ignore this fraud. He and the organization behind him specialize in tricking unsuspecting people into dangerous competitions, and they earn a profit from it.","nextNodeIds":[741660707]},{"nodeId":741660707,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13791,"speakerName":"Strange Person","textMapHash":3682858850,"text":"Don't make up things like that! I haven't tricked anyone! They're all my friends, and they're just signing up willingly after I recommending it to them as a friend!","nextNodeIds":[741660708]},{"nodeId":741660708,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":13792,"speakerName":"Guard","textMapHash":698426634,"text":"Right, I'm sure. I know a better place for you to spout your nonsense. With me, now!","nextNodeIds":[741660709]},{"nodeId":741660709,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":2161013498,"text":"The strange person was escorted away by the guard...","nextNodeIds":[741660710]},{"nodeId":741660710,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1904169466,"text":"Phew... There's no s